o Group, we believe financial services should be professional, personalized, and coordinated around your needs.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="6C1C6578" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00F17826" w:rsidRPr="00105A29" w:rsidRDefault="00F17826" w:rsidP="00F17826"><w:r><w:lastRenderedPageBreak/><w:t>Whether you're managing your personal finances, growing a business, planning retirement, protecting your family, or preparing for the future, we're here to support you every step of the way—just like family.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="186D8D2E" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00F17826" w:rsidRPr="00105A29" w:rsidRDefault="00F17826" w:rsidP="00F17826"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00105A29"><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr><w:t>At Capital Pro Group, we understand that financial decisions are personal. That's why we never believe in a one-size-fits-all approach.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="3DCDD66F" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00F17826" w:rsidRPr="00105A29" w:rsidRDefault="00F17826" w:rsidP="00F17826"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00105A29"><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr><w:t>For many clients, that means accessing comprehensive financial services all under one roof. For others, it means working alongside trusted professionals they have built relationships with over the years.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="1CA8270F" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00F17826" w:rsidRPr="00105A29" w:rsidRDefault="00F17826" w:rsidP="00F17826"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00105A29"><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr><w:t>We respect the value of loyalty and long-standing professional relationships. Whether you're looking for a complete financial team or simply expert guidance in one specific area, we're here to help.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="79EF2FE8" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00F17826" w:rsidRPr="00105A29" w:rsidRDefault="00F17826" w:rsidP="00F17826"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00105A29"><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr><w:t>Our role is to support you, provide knowledgeable advice, and work collaboratively with the professionals you trust, while offering in-house solutions whenever they're needed.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="680DBFBB" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00F17826" w:rsidRPr="00105A29" w:rsidRDefault="00F17826" w:rsidP="00F17826"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00105A29"><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr><w:t>One place. Just like home. </w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="72814ADD" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00F17826" w:rsidRPr="00105A29" w:rsidRDefault="00F17826" w:rsidP="00F17826"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00105A29"><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr><w:t>Life is complex, but managing your finances shouldn't be. Instead of working with multiple advisors and service providers, Capital Pro Group offers comprehensive financial services all under one roof, making it easier to coordinate every aspect of your financial life.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="6521E9A2" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00F17826" w:rsidRDefault="00F17826" w:rsidP="00F17826"><w:pPr><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr></w:pPr><w:r w:rsidRPr="00105A29"><w:rPr><w:bCs/><w:szCs w:val="40"/></w:rPr><w:t>Our integrated approach allows us to create financial strategies that work together seamlessly, helping individuals, families, and businesses make informed decisions with confidence.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p w14:paraId="610CD4AD" w14:textId="77777777" w:rsidR="00F17826" w:rsidRDefault="00F17826" w:rsidP="00F17826"><w:pPr><w:spacing w:line="300" w:lineRule="atLeast"/><w:rPr><w:rFonts w:ascii="Calibri Light" w:eastAsia="Times New Roman" w:hAnsi="Calibri Light" w:cs="Calibri Light"/><w:color w:val="000000"/></w:rPr></w:pP